#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrading-mattermost-server.rst:7
msgid ""
"In most cases, you can upgrade Mattermost Server in a few minutes. "
"However, the upgrade can take longer depending on several factors, "
"including the size and complexity of your installation, and the version "
"that you're upgrading from."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrading-mattermost-server.rst:9
msgid ""
"If this is your first Mattermost upgrade, we recommend that you read the "
"`comprehensive upgrade guide <#comprehensive-upgrade-guide>`__ below. If "
"you're an experienced system admin familiar with the upgrade process, see"
" the `quick start checklist <#quick-start>`__."
msgstr ""

