msgid ""
"Ensure you have a complete backup of your system before proceeding, "
"including database and application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrading-mattermost-server.rst:18
msgid ""
"**System requirements**: Verify that your server and PostgreSQL version "
"meets :doc:`Mattermost requirements </deployment-guide/software-hardware-"
"requirements>`."
msgstr ""

